<section class="blk blk--first">
  <p class="eyebrow">The Projects</p>
  <h1 class="sec">From evidence to real cost reduction.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Public review drafts. No budget, build, pilot, or launch is approved; every brief is a reviewed dossier, not a shipped product.</p>
  <p>The Projects are how Uncost moves from evidence to action: open-source tools, data models, and playbooks that communities and qualified partners can run themselves. We don’t own the farm — we publish the model, the sources, and the playbook, and local operators decide and act.</p>
</section>

<section class="blk blk--cream2">
